"m","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":35,"text":"der Widerspruch","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","gender":"m","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":35,"text":"der Widerspruch","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"m","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Liebe Kursteilnehmer wissen Sie schon was für einen Prüfer Sie bekommen Wir können Ihnen leider nicht mitteilen ob die Prüferin schon feststeht Deshalb bitten wir Sie um Geduld Sie sollten sich trotzdem gut vorbereiten Wir könnten Ihnen die Übungen schicken","authoredText":"Liebe Kursteilnehmer, wissen Sie schon, was für einen Prüfer Sie bekommen? Wir können Ihnen leider nicht mitteilen, ob die Prüferin schon feststeht. Deshalb bitten wir Sie um Geduld. Sie sollten sich trotzdem gut vorbereiten. Wir könnten Ihnen die Übungen schicken.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Aushang: Prüfungsvorbereitung","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Frau Sander, wissen Sie, was für eine Prüfung mich erwartet?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_025_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Es ist ein Test mit Hören, Lesen und Schreiben.","speaker":"Frau Sander","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_025_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Du solltest heute Abend noch einmal alles wiederholen.","speaker":"Frau Sander","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_025_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Ich bin trotzdem sehr nervös.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_025_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Das ist normal, deshalb üben wir jetzt gemeinsam noch fünf Minuten.","speaker":"Frau Sander","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_025_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Frau Sander, wissen Sie, was für eine Prüfung mich erwartet?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_025_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Es ist ein Test mit Hören, Lesen und Schreiben. Du solltest heute Abend noch einmal alles wiederholen.","speaker":"Frau Sander","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_025_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Ich bin trotzdem sehr nervös.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_025_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-25-goethe-mini-3","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Das ist normal, deshalb üben wir jetzt gemeinsam noch fünf Minuten.","speaker":"Frau Sander","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_025_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Ich heiße Lena. Ich lerne jeden Tag, weil ich die Abschlussprüfung machen will.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \